// Step 2.1: the debug API object, stack/function/PC methods. In the break
// loop inside Inner, build the object like NS Debug Tools' CurrentStack()
// does, find Inner's frame, read PCs, and change Inner's PC so that
// execution skips Print("skipped").
// Inner's bytecode: BreakLoop is called at pc 1, so the PC is 2 (the pop of
// its result); Print("skipped") is pc 3-5, its pop pc 6. Setting the PC to 6
// skips both; the pop at 6 removes BreakLoop's result instead.
// Dropping the object and GC() deletes the CNSDebugAPI (checked by ASan).
global Inner(x)
begin
  BreakLoop();
  Print("skipped");
  Print("after");
  x + 1;
end;

Print(Inner(41));
